seindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/71465542597_11_09_21.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/65731542597_23_12_20.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/542597/5425970319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2018/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2018.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2017/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2017.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2016/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2016.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2015/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2015.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2014/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2014.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2013/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2013.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2012/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2012.PDF","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2011","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/HIS_ANN_RPT/HISTANNR/2011/MSTC_LTD-542597-MARCH-2011.PDF","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"MSTC Limited reported a strong Q1 FY27 performance with a 22% year-on-year increase in revenue from operations, driven by record e-commerce revenue. The company has successfully exited its legacy trading and marketing segment and is pivoting toward digital solutions, including EPR certificate trading, a travel portal, and a TReDS platform. Management emphasized an asset-light business model and noted that their joint venture with Mahindra has turned profitable. The company is actively exploring the establishment of its own coal and mineral exchanges while maintaining a focus on double-digit growth. MSTC Limited reported its financial results for the first quarter of fiscal year 2026-27, highlighting record-breaking standalone and consolidated profit figures since its 2019 listing.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company aims to maintain double-digit growth over the long term.","quote":"So, whether that translates into what was the growth over the corresponding period last year or it would be more or less, the average would be a double-digit growth, which we would be trying to maintain.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company aims to achieve double-digit growth in its core e-commerce business.","quote":"It would not be fair to put a number to it, but the attempt shall be to maintain a double-digit growth if possible.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects the positive trend in the joint venture with Mahindra to continue.","quote":"And we expect this trend to strengthen and continue, driving towards a healthy financial outlook for this company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects the EPR trading platform to contribute significantly to revenue.","quote":"But as I said, we are very positive about the fact that it should contribute significantly to our revenue, maybe to start with in the year itself as we go ahead.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company is in the final stages of launching an EPR trading platform and a B2B travel portal.","quote":"The two major such platforms that we are working on, the EPR, that is ETP, which we have already developed, and the next part of our digital project pipeline is a travel portal which is also in the final developmental stages and which we expect to launch shortly.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Management aims to keep overheads under control while scaling operations.","quote":"So, we are trying to have our overheads in control.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA margin was maintained year-on-year despite competitive pressures.","quote":"With respect to the financials, we have been able to maintain EBITDA percentage at a similar level year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"The company has entered into an agreement for the sale of 100 tons of Red sandalwood.","quote":"We had done this exercise about 4-5 years back where we sold some Red sandalwood in the past but again this time also we have entered into an agreement and this transaction will be taking place shortly for sale of about 100 tons of Red sandalwood that is available in the state but this will be through an international competitive bidding.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company successfully secured an order for coal linkage auctions from Coal India Limited.","quote":"And recently we have got an order through competitive bidding for coal linkage auction for Coal India Limited, through open tender.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company's dividend policy is guided by Government of India directives.","quote":"Minimum that is 4% of the net worth or 30% of the PAT, whichever is higher. It is the minimum dividend that a government company has to declare. So, that is guided by that principle.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company is exiting its marketing and trading business to focus on e-commerce.","quote":"So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The scrap business is cyclical, which can impact revenue growth.","quote":"But scrap has always been a cyclical thing. The steel sector as such is very cyclical. So, the rates keep going up and down.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management is monitoring the potential impact of a new coal exchange on its auction revenues.","quote":"So this is something at the very, very initial stages and we shall be watching these developments closely to see how they impact our revenue stream going on.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company aims to operationalize the TReDS platform within FY27.","quote":"So, our internal target is hopefully FY27, within FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company is developing a TREDs platform and has submitted an application to the RBI for approval.","quote":"MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company is upgrading its B2B travel portal to support B2C operations.","quote":"MSTC Travel Portal for B2B is ready and currently being upgraded for Future B2C operation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company will exit the marketing and trading business by the first quarter of FY27.","quote":"So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company expects to launch its B2B travel portal shortly.","quote":"This portal is also in its final stages of testing, and we expect to operationalize it shortly in the B2B space to begin with, and then extend segmental reach as we gain traction.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":18,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":2,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}